"give an empty pattern it will align on the first non-blank character by "
"default.<br>If the pattern has a capture it will indent on the captured "
"match.<br><br><i>Examples</i>:<br>'<code>alignon -</code>' will insert "
"spaces before the first '-' of each lines to align them all on the same "
"column.<br>'<code>alignon :\\s+(.)</code>' will insert spaces before the "
"first non-blank character that occurs after a colon to align them all on the "
"same column."
msgstr "Ova naredba poravnava retke u odabranom bloku ili cijelom dokumentu prema stupcu zadanom regularnim izrazom kao argumentom.<br><br>Ako je uzorak prazan, retci se zadano poravnavaju prema prvom znaku koji nije bjelina.<br>Ako uzorak sadrži grupu za hvatanje, poravnanje se vrši prema uhvaćenom podudaranju.<br><br><i>Primjeri</i>:<br>'<code>alignon -</code>' umeće razmake prije prve crtice '-' u svakom retku i tako ih poravnava u isti stupac.<br>'<code>alignon :\\s+(.)</code>' umeće razmake prije prvog znaka koji nije bjelina nakon dvotočke i tako poravnava retke u isti stupac."

#: script/data/commands/utils.js:434
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Given a JavaScript function as argument, call that for the list of "
"(selected) lines and replace them with the return value of that callback."
"<br>Example (join selected lines):<br><code>each 'function(lines){return "
"lines.join(\", \");}'</code><br>To save you some typing, you can also do "
"this to achieve the same:<br><code>each 'lines.join(\", \")'</code>"
msgstr "Prima JavaScript funkciju kao argument, poziva je za popis (odabranih) redaka i zamjenjuje ih povratnom vrijednošću povratnog poziva.<br>Primjer (spajanje odabranih redaka):<br><code>each 'function(lines){return lines.join(\", \");}'</code><br>Možeš skratiti unos i postići isto ovako:<br><code>each 'lines.join(\", \")'</code>"

#: script/data/commands/utils.js:436
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Given a JavaScript function as argument, call that for the list of "
"(selected) lines and remove those where the callback returns false."
"<br>Example (see also <code>rmblank</code>):<br><code>filter 'function(l)"
"{return l.length > 0;}'</code><br>To save you some typing, you can also do "
"this to achieve the same:<br><code>filter 'line.length > 0'</code>"
msgstr "Prima JavaScript funkciju kao argument, poziva je za popis (odabranih) redaka i uklanja retke za koje povratni poziv vrati false.<br>Primjer (pogledaj i <code>rmblank</code>):<br><code>filter 'function(l){return l.length > 0;}'</code><br>Možeš skratiti unos i postići isto ovako:<br><code>filter 'line.length > 0'</code>"

#: script/data/commands/utils.js:438
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Given a JavaScript function as argument, call that for the list of "
"(selected) lines and replace the line with the return value of the callback."
"<br>Example (see also <code>ltrim</code>):<br><code>map 'function(line)"
"{return line.replace(/^\\s+/, \"\");}'</code><br>To save you some typing, "
"you can also do this to achieve the same:<br><code>map 'line.replace(/^\\s"
"+/, \"\")'</code>"
msgstr "Prima JavaScript funkciju kao argument, poziva je za popis (odabranih) redaka i zamjenjuje svaki redak povratnom vrijednošću povratnog poziva.<br>Primjer (pogledaj i <code>ltrim</code>):<br><code>map 'function(line){return line.replace(/^\\s+/, \"\");}'</code><br>Možeš skratiti unos i postići isto ovako:<br><code>map 'line.replace(/^\\s+/, \"\")'</code>"

